# Let Git auto-detect text vs binary files and normalize line endings to LF
# in the repository, checking them out as CRLF on Windows / LF elsewhere.
# This makes the LF/CRLF conversion explicit instead of relying on each
# contributor's core.autocrlf setting, and silences the per-file
# "LF will be replaced by CRLF" warning on Windows.
* text=auto
